## Metric: 已入职员工平均薪资

在已入职（`status == 1`）子集上对 `salary` 求平均，用于示例网络中的薪酬分布监控（实际币种与单位由数据源约定）。

### Scope

| Scope Type | Scope Ref |
|------------|-----------|
| object_type | employee |

### Calculation Formula

~~~yaml
version: 1
kind: atomic

atomic:
  condition:
    field: status
    operation: ==
    value: 1
  aggregation:
    property: salary
    aggr: avg
~~~

### Time Dimension

| Property | Default Range Policy |
|----------|----------------------|
| create_time | last_24h |

### Analysis Dimensions

| Name | Display Name |
|------|--------------|
| id | 员工ID |
